[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8220.389, "timestamp": "02:17:00", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8236.309, "timestamp": "02:17:16", "text": "但現在我覺得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8239.87, "timestamp": "02:17:19", "text": "我沒那麼在意了。  [音樂] 你知道最搞笑的事嗎？我當時在直播中給唐博士留言助威，大概是凌晨 12 點或 1 點左右，結果不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8251.429, "timestamp": "02:17:31", "text": "小心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8254.309, "timestamp": "02:17:34", "text": "洩露了自己的個人資訊。  所以，嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8267.91, "timestamp": "02:17:47", "text": "呃，有這麼一個人，嗯，他是，他是來自馬的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8277.429, "timestamp": "02:17:57", "text": "Mitsukishi。所以她就說：「Jo"}]